{
  "id": "unique-event-006",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "     #6 - Pighead’s farm\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,907,932]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You explore Pighead’s farm. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,932,964]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find 1 large knife, 1 rope, 3 Food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,964,999]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points, and 1 shotgun (but no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,999,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shotgun shells). Pighead has also\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1029,1063]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a collection of human victims (Save\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1063,1099]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vs. L2 Fear 2 or lose 1 Sanity).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1099,1132]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a little girl chained to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1132,1168]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wall. Her eyes are blank and you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1168,1201]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shudder at the thought of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1201,1231]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "horrors she must have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1231,1253]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "experienced.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1253,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Why didn’t the maniac feed her to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1266,1300]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "his demonic pigs? And why did\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1300,1330]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Pighead draw a rough pentacle\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1330,1360]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with blood on the floor around\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1360,1391]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "her?  You try to talk to the girl but\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1391,1429]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "she won’t respond. You may free\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1429,1461]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "her by going to unique event #8\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1461,1493]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or leave her to her fate. This\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1493,1524]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "however will cause you to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1524,1550]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-006:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically lose 1 Sanity.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[79,1550,1579]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    79
  ]
}
